    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Duffy Auctioneers take great pleasure in presenting to the market 3 Mount Eustace Drive a magnificent two bed mid terrace family home situated in a highly desirable location close to shops and schools and frequent public transport to the city center. Impeccably presented and meticulously maintained by its present house-proud owners this stunning property offers a turnkey solution to any discerning purchaser.  In showroom condition throughout, this fantastic family home boasts a large living room with wooden floor and feature fireplace, fully fitted kitchen with tiled floor and a large landscaped south east facing rear garden. Upstairs off the landing there are two double bedrooms with carpet floor and a fully fitted family bathroom with bath and shower over. This superb location is only minutes away from all local amenities and services including the Tyrrelstown Shopping Centre and the M50/N3 Motorway.\r\nThe rear garden is private and secure. Beautiful family home and well worth the view."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway (2.40m x 1.35m)\r\nWith tiled floor.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining room (5.04m x 3.12m)\r\nFully fitted Kitchen with ample wall and floor mounted units.\r\nDining area with tiled floor.\r\n\r\nLiving room (4.21m x 4.19m)\r\nBeautiful light filled room with wooden floor and feature fireplace.\r\nPatio doors to back garden with shed.\r\n\r\nGuest Toilet (2.31m x 1.03m)\r\nWith tiled floor w.c and w.h.b.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1.     (4.24m x 3.71m)\r\nLarge double bedroom with carpet floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2.    (4.21m x 2.54m)\r\nDouble bedroom with carpet floor.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom.    (2.08m x 1.68m)\r\nFully tiled family bathroom with bath and shower over, w.c and w.h.b.\r\n\r\nOutside.\r\n Landscaped south east facing rear garden."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Stunning two bed Mid Terrace family home.\r\nIn Showroom condition with many extras included in the sale\r\nLarge Living room with feature fireplace and wooden floor\r\nFully fitted modern kitchen with tiled floor.\r\nTwo Large double bedrooms with carpet floor.\r\nFully fitted family bathroom with bath and shower over.\r\nDouble glazed windows.\r\nGas fired central heating.\r\nSouth east facing rear garden.\r\nExcellent location close to shops and schools."
      },
